      "text": "\"\u00a77. There is hereby created a Vacancy Control Board which shall consist of the First Deputy Mayor, as Chairman, the Director of Operations, the Director of the Office of Management and Budget and the Personnel Director. It shall meet regularly, shall maintain appropriate minutes and records and shall have the power to require information needed for evaluation of any request made by an agency pursuant to section six of this Executive Order. The Board shall also have the power to issue such guidelines, forms and instructions as are required for the proper performance of its functions. Such Board shall supersede any prior Board created by Executive Order for a similar purpose.\"",
